-   BEGIN
-    OVER C@ SWAP DUP >R C! R> -1 + SWAP -1 + SWAP
-    R> -1 + DUP >R 0=
-   UNTIL
-   R>
+\ Copy a block of u bytes starting at c-addr1 to c-addr2, a byte at a time
+\ in descending order. The two addresses are one double, set to their last
